      "q": {
        "en": "Does B Street Veterinary Hospital accept emergency walk-in patients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital accepts walk-ins and operates an emergency triage system, though less urgent cases may experience lengthy waiting times."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
