        "en": "How do fees compare to other emergency veterinary clinics in San Diego?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently describe the clinic as one of the most affordable options in the area for urgent veterinary care."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are wait times predictable for walk-in consultations?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report that wait times fluctuate significantly because emergency cases take priority over non-critical visits."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pets undergo emergency surgery at this hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients recount lifesaving emergency surgeries performed for conditions such as organ trauma, herniated discs, and severe infections."
      },
